    {
      "name": "lock",
      "description": "Acquire an advisory path lease (default 60 seconds). tree includes descendants. On conflict wait or contact the owner. Renew before expiry. Symlinks resolve before parent traversal; case and Unicode normalization aliases conflict even on case-sensitive disks. Reacquire after path topology changes.",
